{
  "id": 299454406,
  "iid": 15504,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "wimax: move a shared preference to a header file.",
  "description": "Don't declare it privately in each file that uses it; that's a recipe\nfor disaster, as, for example, a change to the type of the preference in\nthe file that defines it, without corresponding changes to all files\nthat declare it, won't be detected.\n\nFixes #19822, which is the result of such a change.",
