      ],
      "title": "wimax: move shared preferences to a header file.",
      "message": "wimax: move shared preferences to a header file.\n\nDon't declare them privately in each file that uses it; that's a recipe\nfor disaster, as, for example, a change to the type of the preference in\nthe file that defines it, without corresponding changes to all files\nthat declare it, won't be detected.\n\nFixes #19822, which is the result of such a change.\n",
      "author_name": "Guy Harris",
      "author_email": "gharris@sonic.net",
      "authored_date": "2024-05-02T00:23:05.000-07:00",
      "committer_name": "Guy Harris",
      "committer_email": "gharris@sonic.net",
      "committed_date": "2024-05-02T01:03:00.000-07:00",
